# Azure AI Speech — pronunciation assessment
#
# Create a Speech resource at:
#   https://portal.azure.com/#create/Microsoft.CognitiveServicesSpeechServices
# Pick the F0 tier (5 free audio hours per month) and a nearby region.
# The key and region are then under "Keys and Endpoint".
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values. .env is gitignored.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WARNING — read before deploying this app anywhere
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the built JavaScript bundle. The key
# below is therefore NOT secret in a build: anyone who can load the page can
# read it and spend your quota.
#
# That is acceptable while the app runs locally for a single user, which is the
# current decision. It is NOT acceptable for a published or downloadable build.
# For that, the key has to move behind a token endpoint that hands out
# short-lived tokens. See planning/PLAN.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=
VITE_AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=westeurope
